// A run target before a named item is no run target: the linker folds named
// items around one final expression, and refuses an expression anywhere else
// as a stray, a root child that is no declaration. Its twin,
// `model/basics/definitions.gandr`, runs the final one.

/// An expression before a definition, a stray.
@[ refuses("OutOfFragment.WrongSort.declaration") ]
1;

/// A definition after it.
def late = 2;
